      "text": "It’s a metaphor I keep coming back to; a nation can have a decisive lead and then simply throw it away for bad, short-term reasons.\n\nAnd the damning thing is, you’ll probably not realise how bad a decision it was in your own lifetime. You’ll think you won.",
