      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-09 15:20:37",
      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "The Cybertruck order rate far exceeds our production rate. We will try to make as many as possible before shutting down the line in about 8 months, but will have to return deposits for a lot of people.\n\nThis is not a case of Cybertruck being unprofitable, as has been misreported by legacy media, but rather that the opportunity cost of the complexity of Cybertruck is vastly outweighed by the value of incremental Cybercab production.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "jamesdouma",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/988101297357258752/Kg-unit-_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-09 00:01:41",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-08T16:01:41.000Z",
        "id": "2119460358826176575",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWnV9q6bAAA7UCD.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 364,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWnV9q6bAAA7UCD.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 1232
          }
        ],
        "name": "jimmah",
        "text": "Seriously. It’s incomparable. But cars are going to become robots, their forms and functions will change, and we won’t be coming back to this moment.  Get it while you can.",
        "url": "https://x.com/jamesdouma/status/2119460358826176575",
